<article>
  <section>
    <h2>Features</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        🖼️ Supports both
        <code>&lt;Image&gt;</code>
        and
        <code>&lt;Picture&gt;</code>
        components and CSS background images.
      </li>
      <li>🎨 Multiple LQIP techniques: base64, solid color, CSS via gradients and SVG.</li>
      <li>
        🚀 Easy to use, just replace the native Astro components by
        {' '}
        <a href="https://npmx.dev/package/astro-lqip" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">astro-lqip</a>
        .
      </li>
      <li>⚡️ Support images as static imports or using string paths.</li>
      <li>
        🔧 Fully compatible with
        <a href="https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/images/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Astro's image optimization features</a>
        .
      </li>
      <li>🌍 Supports both local and remote images.</li>
      <li>
        ⚙️ Supports SSR mode with
        <a href="https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/integrations-guide/node/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Node Adapter</a>
        .
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</article>
